    {
      "id": 131,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [60, 100],
      "size": [560, 760],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 13,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Upscale a video 2 or 4 times with SeedVR2",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Upscale a video 2 or 4 times with SeedVR2\n\nRaises the resolution of one clip by 2 or 4 times with SeedVR2 and keeps its frame rate and sound. The model file is an input, so the same graph runs the 3B and the 7B model. Built from Comfy's template upscale_video_seedvr2_3b_int8.\n\n## Models\n\n- [seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors): SeedVR2 VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B).\n- [seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors): SeedVR2 3B, int8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/ByteDance-Seed/SeedVR2-3B).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
